notification_templates.body:
Hi {{candidate_name}},

We are excited to invite you to interview for the {{job_title}} position at {{company_name}}.

Here are your interview details:
- Date/Time: {{datetime}}
- Duration: {{duration}} minutes
- Interviewer: {{interviewer_name}}
- Platform: {{platform}}
{{meeting_link_section}}

Please let us know if you have any questions or need to reschedule.

Best regards,

{{recruiter_name}}
{{company_name}} Team

Dear {{candidate_name}},

On behalf of {{company_name}}, we are thrilled to offer you the position of {{job_title}}!

We were incredibly impressed by your skills and experience, and we believe you will be a fantastic addition to our team.

Here is a summary of the offer details:
- Title: {{job_title}}
- Base Salary: {{salary}} per year
- Employment Type: {{employment_type}}
- Proposed Start Date: {{start_date}}

Please find the full offer letter attached or viewable via your profile dashboard. To accept, please sign and return this document by {{deadline}}.

Welcome to the team!

Sincerely,

{{recruiter_name}}
{{company_name}} Team

Hi {{candidate_name}},

This is a friendly reminder of your upcoming interview round for the {{job_title}} position at {{company_name}}.

Upcoming Session Details:
- Subject: {{interview_title}}
- Date/Time: {{datetime}}
- Interviewer: {{interviewer_name}}
- Platform: {{platform}}
{{meeting_link_section}}

Please make sure to have a stable internet connection, turn your camera on, and join 3 minutes before the scheduled start time.

Best regards,

{{recruiter_name}}
{{company_name}} Team
